---
description: Use Kling AI for image, video, motion, asset, account, and task requests
globs:
alwaysApply: false
---

For Kling requests, use `$kling-ai` and route generation to
`$kling-ai-generate-image` or `$kling-ai-generate-video`. Use only the
configured `Plugin-Cursor-kling-ai` Global MCP at `https://kling.ai/mcp`.
Confirm final billable settings immediately before generation, submit each
confirmed intent at most once, and let a mounted generation MCP App refresh
its own `generationId`. Do not call `query_tasks` for that submission from the
model; each call creates another Cursor tool card. If no App is mounted, return
the task number instead of model-loop polling. Call `query_tasks` exactly once
only for an explicit standalone status request. Never switch regions or start
or depend on a local Kling MCP server.
